 and cultists. The graphics are good and the performance is great for me. I often play listening to music as the sound isn't really that important after a while, and it just adds to my overall chill. \r\n\r\nLooking for a game that isn't too taxing, pretty to look at, and good fun - this is worth a shot, imo.", "timestamp_created": 1713538577, "timestamp_updated": 1713538577, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 41, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.667782485485076904", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "163137113", "author": {"steamid": "76561198132542256", "personaname": "ImMisterWumbo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198132542256/", "num_games_owned": 1328, "num_reviews": 107, "playtime_forever": 16, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16, "last_played": 1713488205, "avatar": "0e52a6a0a86baa7cc60e5ff91f915df25f51ba60"}, "language": "english", "review": ">See Redfall is on sale\n>Purchase\n>Realize its still garbage 16 minutes in\n>Refund\n>Refuse to elaborate", "timestamp_created": 1713488343, "timestamp_updated": 1713488343, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500734388828277588", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}]}